30.6 and T t four of 1 600 kelvin.

53
00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:49.739
Both nozzles are convergent, and
the design point is cruise at 11

54
00:03:49.779 --> 00:03:56.207
km, Mach 0.8, with a total mass
