98
00:07:48.780 --> 00:07:52.884
Now the thrust, term by term:
the core jet gives 14.54

99
00:07:52.924 --> 00:07:57.255
kilonewtons of momentum, the
fan jet 42.62, the ram drag of

100
00:07:57.295 --> 00:08:02.648
