104
00:08:23.852 --> 00:08:28.939
The kinetic energy increment of
the two streams is 5.72 megawatts.

105
00:08:28.989 --> 00:08:33.542
So the thermal efficiency is 18.4
%, low because of the modest

106
00:08:33.582 --> 00:08:37.859
