112
00:08:58.295 --> 00:09:02.428
Watch the core stream being built station
by station from the computed totals:

113
00:09:02.468 --> 00:09:06.992
first the free ram compression from the
static free-stream to the total state.

114
00:09:07.042 --> 00:09:12.097
Then the fan and the two compressors
climb to 771 kelvin, each

115
00:09:12.137 --> 00:09:16.077
process drifting to the right
because losses generate entropy.

116
00:09:16.127 --> 00:09:20.483
The burner adds heat up to 1
600 kelvin at slightly falling

117
00:09:20.523 --> 00:09:25.834
pressure, and the two turbines
expand the gas down to 1 046 kelvin.

118
00:09:25.884 --> 00:09:30.542
Finally the nozzle accelerates the
