120
00:09:35.340 --> 00:09:38.702
Two cautions for the sketch:
this is an open trace of total

121
00:09:38.742 --> 00:09:42.278
states with losses, not a closed
reversible cycle, so the area

122
00:09:42.318 --> 00:09:45.968
under or inside it is not the net
work; and the bypass stream is

123
00:09:46.008 --> 00:09:50.005
