202
00:15:34.833 --> 00:15:38.022
Without the fan, the low
pressure compressor starts from

203
00:15:38.062 --> 00:15:42.808
the inlet temperature, so it
ends at 416.6 kelvin, the

204
00:15:42.848 --> 00:15:49.022
